tive_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121946","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121946.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121946.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-02T14:42:28Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Simplifies reasoning by getting rid of a soft type occurrence.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nA soft type, that is type with a `type_source == INFERRED` will be treated like `Variant` in most cases (see e.g. `_gdtype_from_datatype`). Thus there is no reason to have `kind == VARIANT` type with `type_source == INFERRED`. If a place uses the type and does not check for `type_source` this change makes no difference. If a place uses the type and does check for `type_source` it will still treat the type as `Variant`\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121946/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"la